- They're talking murder on it!

28
00:03:07.238 --> 00:03:08.136
Normal TV.
and they're just talking!

29
00:03:08.138 --> 00:03:09.238
Your sister just
had a friend she loved...

30
00:03:09.240 --> 00:03:11.240
