34
00:03:18.582 --> 00:03:21.149
Alice. you can keep watching your
show. it's fine.

35
00:03:21.151 --> 00:03:22.384
ALICE: No. I guessed
who did it anyway.

36
00:03:22.386 --> 00:03:24.319
- It's okay.
- I'm sorry. Marta.

37
00:03:24.321 --> 00:03:25.955
- It's okay.
- (CELL PHONE BUZZING)

38
00:03:27.558 --> 00:03:28.758
It's Harlan's son.

39
00:03:32.463 --> 00:03:33.562
Hi. Walt.

40
00:03:33.564 --> 00:03:35.830
- <i>Hi. Marta. it's Walt.</i>
- Mmm-hmm.

41
00:03:35.832 --> 00:03:37.865
<i>Would you mind coming
to the house early?</i>

42
00:03:37.867 --> 00:03:41.035
<i>The police have a few
more questions for everybody.</i>

43
00:03:41.037 --> 00:03:42.172
What?

44
00:04:01.924 --> 00:04:03.958
POLICEMAN: Hey.
Excuse me. ma'am.

45
00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:05.093
You with the help?

46
00:04:05.095 --> 00:04:07.962
MEG: Hey! Her name's Marta.
She was Grandad's nurse.

47
00:04:07.964 --> 00:04:10.898
