fully formed.

161
00:08:42.873 --> 00:08:44.439
It was the easy part for him.

162
00:08:44.441 --> 00:08:46.575
(PLAYS NOTE ON PIANO)

163
00:08:46.577 --> 00:08:48.610
ELLIOTT: Um. so you're
in the area. right?

164
00:08:48.612 --> 00:08:51.313
Uh. you guys probably
arrived around the same time.

165
00:08:51.315 --> 00:08:53.214
Uh...

166
00:08:53.216 --> 00:08:55.650
We all got here
around 8:00.

167
00:08:55.652 --> 00:08:57.819
<i>My wife. Donna. she's my rock.</i>

168
00:08:57.821 --> 00:08:59.588
- (FORK CLATTERS)
- (SHRIEKS)

169
00:08:59.590 --> 00:09:02.357
Jesus. Donna!
Are you all right?

170
00:09:02.359 --> 00:09:05.293
WALT: <i>My son. Jacob. he's 16.</i>

171
00:09:05.295 --> 00:09:07.596
<i>Very politically active.</i>

172
00:09:07.598 --> 00:09:09.364
The boy is
literally a Nazi.

173
00:09:09.366 --> 00:09:11.700
He's an alt-right
troll dipshit.

174
00:09:11.702 --> 00:09:14.569
Kids today with the
Internet. it's amazing.

175
00:09:14.571 --> 00:09:16.540
ELLIOTT: (CHUCKLES)
So the night went well?

176
00:09:18.709 --> 00:09:20.675
WALT: <i>I mean.
we're all gutted. but. uh.</i>

177
00:09:20.677 --> 00:09:22.911
<i>I was happy to have
that night with him.</i>

178
00:09:22.913 --> 00:09:25.447
<i>To be by his side.
To think about our books</i>

179
00:09:25.449 --> 00:09:28.183
<i>and what we've accomplished
with them.</i>

180
00:09:28.185 --> 00:09:30.854
It's like I can still feel
his hand on my shoulder.

181
00:09:32.422 --> 00:09:34.322
Passing the torch.

182
00:09:34.324 --> 00:09:36.558
ELLIOTT: So. we're here
with Joni Thrombey.

183
00:09:36.560 --> 00:09:38.593
Harlan Thrombey's
daughter-in-law?

184
00:09:38.595 --> 00:09:41.396
Mmm-hmm.
Yeah. I married his son. Neil.

185
00:09:41.398 --> 00:09:43.498
We had one daughter. Meg.

186
00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:47.502
And then Neil passed on
15 years ago.

187
00:09:47.504 --> 00:09:49.604
But you remained close
to the Thrombeys?

188
00:09:49.606 --> 00:09:52.307
Oh! They're my family.

189
00:09:52.309 --> 00:09:54.943
