190
00:09:54.945 --> 00:09:58.313
JONI: <i>I feel
simultaneously freed by</i>

191
00:09:58.315 --> 00:10:01.383
<i>and supported by them.</i>

192
00:10:01.385 --> 00:10:03.520
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

193
00:10:04.888 --> 00:10:08.325
It's that balance of opposites
that's the nugget of Flam.

194
00:10:08.992 --> 00:10:10.525
Sorry. the nugget of...

195
00:10:10.527 --> 00:10:11.893
Flam.

196
00:10:11.895 --> 00:10:15.230
(CHUCKLES) Oh. Yeah. Flam.
your skincare company. Sorry.

197
00:10:15.232 --> 00:10:16.433
I forgive you.

198
00:10:16.967 --> 00:10:18.299
Yeah. it's skincare.

199
00:10:18.301 --> 00:10:20.502
