234
00:11:32.709 --> 00:11:33.775
No one's
saying that. okay?

235
00:11:33.777 --> 00:11:35.445
This is all
pro-forma.

236
00:11:35.979 --> 00:11:36.980
Okay.

237
00:11:37.881 --> 00:11:39.683
So who the fuck is that?

238
00:11:40.584 --> 00:11:41.649
Um...

239
00:11:41.651 --> 00:11:43.885
This is
Benoit Blanc.

240
00:11:43.887 --> 00:11:46.688
- (CHUCKLES) Benoit Blanc?
- ELLIOTT: Yes.

241
00:11:46.690 --> 00:11:48.490
Mr. Blanc is
a private investigator

242
00:11:48.492 --> 00:11:49.657
