1977
01:23:14.644 --> 01:23:17.379
(FOOTSTEPS APPROACHING)

1978
01:23:17.381 --> 01:23:19.316
BENOIT: Good morning.
Mrs. Thrombey.

1979
01:23:24.854 --> 01:23:27.624
Why is grief
the providence of youth?

1980
01:23:29.025 --> 01:23:30.227
I don't know.

1981
01:23:32.829 --> 01:23:37.068
But I'd imagine that age
deepens all feelings.

1982
01:23:38.735 --> 01:23:40.104
Including grief.

1983
01:23:42.972 --> 01:23:47.610
This was a long walk
to offering condolences

1984
01:23:48.345 --> 01:23:49.979
for the loss of your son.

1985
01:23:51.315 --> 01:23:53.948
And asking you.
if it isn't presumptuous of me.

1986
01:23:53.950 --> 01:23:58.220
not to think too harshly
of your family.

1987
01:23:58.222 --> 01:24:02.926
if I am. as I suspect.
the first to console you.

1988
01:24:04.395 --> 01:24:06.996
They're young. aren't they?

1989
01:24:12.303 --> 01:24:15.372
One thing I assume of age

1990
01:24:16.005 --> 01:24:18.173
is weariness.

1991
01:24:18.175 --> 01:24:21.443
Damned if I don't get
more tired every day.

1992
01:24:21.445 --> 01:24:23.878
Tired of what I do.

1993
01:24:23.880 --> 01:24:26.914
Following arcs
like lobbed rocks.

1994
01:24:26.916 --> 01:24:29.086
the inevitability of truth.

1995
01:24:32.123 --> 01:24:34.158
But the complexity and the gray

1996
01:24:35.292 --> 01:24:37.026
lie not in the truth

1997
01:24:38.429 --> 01:24:41.764
but what you do with the truth
once you have it.

1998
01:24:49.206 --> 01:24:52.176
I think you have something
you wanna tell me.

1999
01:24:53.977 --> 01:24:56.878
I think you're
very perceptive

2000
01:24:56.880 --> 01:25:00.115
and very capable of
telling me what you saw

2001
01:25:00.117 --> 01:25:02.153
the night
of your son's party.

2002
01:25:10.394 --> 01:25:12.196
But I'll happily wait.

2003
01:25:13.029 --> 01:25:14.365
I'm in no rush.

2004
01:25:15.865 --> 01:25:16.998
In fact.

2005
01:25:17.000 --> 01:25:19.101
I find it quiet pleasant

2006
01:25:19.103 --> 01:25:20.770
sitting here with you.

2007
01:25:23.773 --> 01:25:26.042
(OPERA MUSIC CONTINUES)

2008
01:25:29.012 --> 01:25:30.179
Lawyers were here.

2009
01:25:30.181 --> 01:25:31.779
Very big lawyers.
it looked like.

2010
01:25:31.781 --> 01:25:33.915
They left all this stuff
and business cards.

2011
01:25:33.917 --> 01:25:35.284
And there was
a pile of other stuff

2012
01:25:35.286 --> 01:25:37.186
- when I got home.
- (SPEAKING SPANISH)

2013
01:25:37.188 --> 01:25:38.986
(IN ENGLISH) I don't like
any of this. Marta.

2014
01:25:38.988 --> 01:25:39.854
(SPEAKS SPANISH)

2015
01:25:39.856 --> 01:25:41.390
(IN ENGLISH)
I don't like it either.

2016
01:25:41.392 --> 01:25:43.392
I'm slipping out the back.

2017
01:25:43.394 --> 01:25:45.962
I'll be back later.
Please don't talk to anyone.

2018
01:25:46.463 --> 01:25:48.031
(SPEAKS SPANISH)

2019
01:25:52.536 --> 01:25:53.736
Walt?

2020
01:25:54.505 --> 01:25:57.105
Yeah. I came. uh...

2021
01:25:57.107 --> 01:25:58.407
Hey. how you doin'?

2022
01:25:58.409 --> 01:25:59.476
(CHUCKLES)

2023
01:26:01.145 --> 01:26:02.344
Walt. I want you to know

2024
01:26:02.346 --> 01:26:03.911
that I didn't know
about any of this.

2025
01:26:03.913 --> 01:26:05.247
- We know you didn't.
- This is...

2026
01:26:05.249 --> 01:26:07.049
We know you didn't.

2027
01:26:07.051 --> 01:26:10.052
Yeah. we all kind of went
a little crazy yesterday.

2028
01:26:10.054 --> 01:26:11.754
- Understandable.
- Yeah.

2029
01:26:13.224 --> 01:26:15.190
I haven't even
looked at all this. yet.

2030
01:26:15.192 --> 01:26:17.959
WALT: It must just be
local lawyers and accountants

2031
01:26:17.961 --> 01:26:20.362
who saw the news
and wanna get a jump on it.

2032
01:26:20.364 --> 01:26:22.732
Yeah. I'd be careful
of all of it.

2033
01:26:24.901 --> 01:26:29.073
Marta. is it your intention
to renounce the inheritance?

2034
01:26:32.343 --> 01:26:34.777
This is what Harlan wanted.

2035
01:26:35.412 --> 01:26:36.545
(SIGHS)

2036
01:26:36.547 --> 01:26:38.447
Yeah. but...

2037
01:26:38.449 --> 01:26:41.185
Harlan put you in a very hard
position here. I mean.

2038
01:26:41.951 --> 01:26:43.087
it was unfair of him.

2039
01:26:44.121 --> 01:26:45.820
I mean. you see

2040
01:26:45.822 --> 01:26:48.956
the kind of press and scrutiny
that this kicks up

2041
01:26:48.958 --> 01:26:51.528
and we know.
with your mother...

2042
01:26:53.029 --> 01:26:54.129
My mother?

2043
01:26:54.131 --> 01:26:55.132
Yeah.

2044
01:27:00.504 --> 01:27:03.105
What did Meg tell you?

2045
01:27:03.107 --> 01:27:04.774
Oh. this isn't about...
(CHUCKLES)

2046
01:27:06.510 --> 01:27:07.942
You're missing the point.

2047
01:27:07.944 --> 01:27:10.011
We don't wanna
attack you with this.

2048
01:27:10.013 --> 01:27:11.346
but. Marta. if your mother

2049
01:27:11.348 --> 01:27:13.981
came into the
country illegally.

2050
01:27:13.983 --> 01:27:15.183
criminally.

2051
01:27:15.185 --> 01:27:17.119
And you've come
into this inheritance.

2052
01:27:17.121 --> 01:27:18.953
with all the scrutiny
that entails.

2053
01:27:18.955 --> 01:27:21.356
I'd be afraid
that could come to light.

2054
01:27:21.358 --> 01:27:23.425
And that's what
we wanna avoid here.

2055
01:27:23.427 --> 01:27:24.528
We can protect you

2056
01:27:25.462 --> 01:27:26.861
from that happening.

2057
01:27:26.863 --> 01:27:28.863
or if it happens.

2058
01:27:28.865 --> 01:27:33.302
So you're saying that
even if it came to light.

2059
01:27:33.304 --> 01:27:36.071
with your family's resources.
you could help me fix it?

2060
01:27:36.073 --> 01:27:37.372
Yeah.

2061
01:27:37.374 --> 01:27:39.508
Yeah. with the right
lawyers. you know?

2062
01:27:39.510 --> 01:27:40.975
Not these local guys.

2063
01:27:40.977 --> 01:27:43.545
but New York lawyers.
DC lawyers.

2064
01:27:43.547 --> 01:27:46.013
with enough resources
put toward it. yes.

2065
01:27:46.015 --> 01:27:49.018
Not that that ever even
needs to come up.

2066
01:27:49.919 --> 01:27:50.920
but. yes.

2067
01:27:52.356 --> 01:27:53.557
Okay. good.

2068
01:27:55.459 --> 01:27:56.460
Okay?

2069
01:27:57.428 --> 01:28:01.496
Because Harlan gave me
all your resources.

2070
01:28:01.498 --> 01:28:03.165
So that means
with my resources.

2071
01:28:03.167 --> 01:28:04.899
I'll be able to fix it.

2072
01:28:04.901 --> 01:28:06.967
So I guess
I will find the right lawyers.

2073
01:28:06.969 --> 01:28:08.205
Uh. Marta. that's...

2074
01:28:10.674 --> 01:28:12.476
You better be sure that's

2075
01:28:13.910 --> 01:28:15.112
what you want.

2076
01:28:34.598 --> 01:28:36.633
(CELL PHONE BUZZING)

2077
01:28:49.713 --> 01:28:51.548
(BIRDS CHIRPING)

2078
01:28:53.217 --> 01:28:55.083
RANSOM: I don't know...
What's this?

2079
01:28:55.085 --> 01:28:56.585
MARTA: It's my
medical bag tag.

2080
01:28:56.587 --> 01:28:59.354
They have my medical bag
for some reason.

2081
01:28:59.356 --> 01:29:01.623
Okay. but this is a photocopy
of just the header

2082
01:29:01.625 --> 01:29:04.559
of a blood toxicology report
on Harlan.

2083
01:29:04.561 --> 01:29:07.295
Marta. this is gonna show
the morphine overdose.

2084
01:29:07.297 --> 01:29:09.299
(BREATHING HEAVILY)

2085
01:29:10.267 --> 01:29:11.268
So I'm screwed?

2086
01:29:13.370 --> 01:29:15.137
How do you know all this stuff?

2087
01:29:15.139 --> 01:29:17.307
I was Harlan's research
assistant for a summer.

2088
01:29:18.442 --> 01:29:20.475
But what kind of
blackmail scheme is this?

2089
01:29:20.477 --> 01:29:21.976
I mean. the actual evidence

2090
01:29:21.978 --> 01:29:24.044
is sitting up the street.
at the crime lab.

2091
01:29:24.046 --> 01:29:26.250
There's no demands.
there's no meeting place.

2092
01:29:28.485 --> 01:29:30.287
What's the point
in sending you this?

2093
01:29:32.256 --> 01:29:33.557
(SIREN WAILING)

2094
01:29:40.597 --> 01:29:41.730
FIRE CHIEF: It could be
a half hour.

2095
01:29:41.732 --> 01:29:43.331
It could be an hour.
It depends.

2096
01:29:43.333 --> 01:29:44.501
We wanna make sure...

2097
01:29:50.607 --> 01:29:51.740
(WHISTLES)

2098
01:29:51.742 --> 01:29:53.308
FIRE CHIEF:
So. it could take a while.

2099
01:29:53.310 --> 01:29:54.609
- BENOIT: What's the cheese?
- But I'll let you know.

2100
01:29:54.611 --> 01:29:56.178
- ELLIOTT: Oh. hey.
- FIRE CHIEF: Yeah.

2101
01:29:56.180 --> 01:29:57.612
- ELLIOTT: Thank you. Chief.
- FIRE CHIEF: No problem.

2102
01:29:57.614 --> 01:29:58.547
5:00 a.m.

2103
01:29:58.549 --> 01:30:00.782
Security systems
here are all triggered.

2104
01:30:00.784 --> 01:30:02.684
Now. this thing
went up really quick.

2105
01:30:02.686 --> 01:30:04.586
so that means
blood stores. records.

2106
01:30:04.588 --> 01:30:06.788
anything of that nature.
it's all gone.

2107
01:30:06.790 --> 01:30:08.457
There were no
employees here.

2108
01:30:08.459 --> 01:30:10.659
- so. thank God for that.
- Mmm-hmm.

2109
01:30:10.661 --> 01:30:12.529
What about security cameras?

2110
01:30:13.130 --> 01:30:14.131
Oh. yeah.

2111
01:30:16.533 --> 01:30:18.266
Speaking of security.

2112
01:30:18.268 --> 01:30:19.734
the surveillance tape
at the Thrombey estate

2113
01:30:19.736 --> 01:30:22.038
was all scrambled
for some reason.

2114
01:30:22.306 --> 01:30:24.239
Yeah.

2115
01:30:24.241 --> 01:30:27.041
What's still pending
from the autopsy?

2116
01:30:27.043 --> 01:30:28.512
Just a report
on the blood work.

2117
01:30:30.247 --> 01:30:31.348
Blood work?

2118
01:30:36.353 --> 01:30:37.721
MARTA: Holy shit.

2119
01:30:41.225 --> 01:30:42.593
This is insane.

2120
01:30:44.228 --> 01:30:46.728
I mean. who would blow up
a whole real building

2121
01:30:46.730 --> 01:30:48.129
just to blackmail me?

2122
01:30:48.131 --> 01:30:49.331
Marta. this means
the blackmailer

2123
01:30:49.333 --> 01:30:50.565
has the only paper copy

2124
01:30:50.567 --> 01:30:52.334
of the thing that
can prove your guilt.

2125
01:30:52.336 --> 01:30:53.768
You didn't get
any other instructions?

2126
01:30:53.770 --> 01:30:55.504
No phone call?
No email? Nothing?

2127
01:30:55.506 --> 01:30:57.472
No.

2128
01:30:57.474 --> 01:30:59.443
Well. I haven't
checked my email.

2129
01:31:04.681 --> 01:31:06.381
There is one.

2130
01:31:06.383 --> 01:31:09.753
RANSOM: Yeah. that's it.
"1209. Columbus Road. 10 a.m."

2131
01:31:16.159 --> 01:31:17.259
You know
what this means. right?

2132
01:31:17.261 --> 01:31:18.793
If you destroy that copy.

2133
01:31:18.795 --> 01:31:20.364
you're totally in the clear.

2134
01:31:21.131 --> 01:31:22.299
MARTA: Oh. no.

2135
01:31:23.667 --> 01:31:25.335
Marta. did you hear me?

2136
01:31:27.704 --> 01:31:28.705
MARTA: Yeah.

2137
01:31:30.874 --> 01:31:32.442
(TIRES SQUEAL)

2138
01:31:36.813 --> 01:31:38.213
Elliott!

2139
01:31:38.215 --> 01:31:39.383
We gotta go!
We gotta go!

2140
01:31:42.319 --> 01:31:44.519
- Okay. baby driver.
- Oh. God.

2141
01:31:44.521 --> 01:31:45.854
You regret helping me yet?

2142
01:31:45.856 --> 01:31:47.522
I regret not
taking the Beemer.

2143
01:31:47.524 --> 01:31:49.591
(SIRENS WAILING)

2144
01:31:49.593 --> 01:31:51.293
MARTA: Oh. shit.

2145
01:31:51.295 --> 01:31:53.063
(CELL PHONE VIBRATING)

2146
01:32:04.808 --> 01:32:05.874
Vehicles in pursuit

2147
01:32:05.876 --> 01:32:06.841
- on Washington Street.
- No force.

2148
01:32:06.843 --> 01:32:08.443
- Make sure you say "no force."
- No force.

2149
01:32:08.445 --> 01:32:09.511
We got a possible
murder suspect.

2150
01:32:09.513 --> 01:32:10.681
I said that. I said that.

2151
01:32:11.615 --> 01:32:12.681
(ENGINE RUMBLING)

2152
01:32:12.683 --> 01:32:14.716
Go. Go! Go!
Are you flooring it?

2153
01:32:14.718 --> 01:32:16.420
I am literally flooring it!

2154
01:32:20.824 --> 01:32:22.759
(CELL PHONE VIBRATING)

2155
01:32:24.161 --> 01:32:25.228
(HORN HONKING)

2156
01:32:25.696 --> 01:32:27.495
(MOUTHING)

2157
01:32:27.497 --> 01:32:29.331
- This is going well.
- I'm pulling over. I'm...

2158
01:32:29.333 --> 01:32:30.398
If you miss your chance

2159
01:32:30.400 --> 01:32:31.802
to get this tox report.
it's all over.

2160
01:32:32.502 --> 01:32:33.704
Oh. my God.

2161
01:32:35.439 --> 01:32:36.838
(BRAKES SCREECH)

2162
01:32:36.840 --> 01:32:38.573
- Whoa!
- Whoa!

2163
01:32:38.575 --> 01:32:39.941
Why... Why are we stopping?

2164
01:32:39.943 --> 01:32:42.312
Why are you stopping
in the middle of the road?

2165
01:32:50.420 --> 01:32:51.822
(SIRENS CONTINUE WAILING)

2166
01:32:55.359 --> 01:32:56.360
Hold on.

2167
01:32:57.661 --> 01:32:59.196
(HORN HONKING)

2168
01:33:20.350 --> 01:33:22.851
MARTA: Oh. my God. I'm just
pure adrenaline right now.

2169
01:33:22.853 --> 01:33:24.753
I feel like I swallowed bees.

2170
01:33:24.755 --> 01:33:25.620
Okay...

2171
01:33:25.622 --> 01:33:27.422
So where is it?
What's the address?

2172
01:33:27.424 --> 01:33:28.857
1209. Columbus Road.

2173
01:33:28.859 --> 01:33:30.759
Okay. I mean.
whatever they want.

2174
01:33:30.761 --> 01:33:32.227
- I'll say yes...
- Anything.

2175
01:33:32.229 --> 01:33:33.595
You know. just to get
that report back.

2176
01:33:33.597 --> 01:33:35.764
- Get it back and destroy it.
- Destroy it.

2177
01:33:35.766 --> 01:33:37.334
Holy shit. Ransom.

2178
01:33:38.001 --> 01:33:39.603
Hey. thank you.

2179
01:33:40.537 --> 01:33:42.205
I couldn't do this without you.

2180
01:33:45.342 --> 01:33:47.310
- (INDISTINCT RADIO CHATTER)
- Oh. my God.

2181
01:33:48.779 --> 01:33:49.780
Get out.

2182
01:33:51.581 --> 01:33:54.683
That was the dumbest
car chase of all time.

2183
01:33:54.685 --> 01:33:56.017
Put your hands down.

2184
01:33:56.019 --> 01:33:58.687
I spoke to Wanetta Thrombey.
Greatnana.

2185
01:33:58.689 --> 01:34:00.522
Night of the party.
she saw someone

2186
01:34:00.524 --> 01:34:03.258
climbing the trellis
to the third floor.

2187
01:34:03.260 --> 01:34:05.694
- Mr. Drysdale. come on.
- WAGNER: Let's go.

2188
01:34:05.696 --> 01:34:07.629
ELLIOTT: Pat him down.
check him out.

2189
01:34:07.631 --> 01:34:09.431
MARTA: What's going on?

2190
01:34:09.433 --> 01:34:11.332
BENOIT: "Ransom came back."
she said.

2191
01:34:11.334 --> 01:34:12.567
WAGNER: Hands on the vehicle.

2192
01:34:12.569 --> 01:34:13.802
I don't know
what he came back to do.

2193
01:34:13.804 --> 01:34:14.969
but we'll find out.

2194
01:34:14.971 --> 01:34:17.305
WAGNER: You got anything sharp?

2195
01:34:17.307 --> 01:34:19.274
Watch your head. Thank you.

2196
01:34:19.276 --> 01:34:20.241
Hey. you don't need
to thank him.

2197
01:34:20.243 --> 01:34:23.447
Did he ask you to drive
when he saw me coming?

2198
01:34:24.981 --> 01:34:26.283
Yes.

2199
01:34:29.319 --> 01:34:30.652
(STOMACH GURGLES)

2200
01:34:30.654 --> 01:34:32.689
(GAGS. RETCHES)

2201
01:34:33.724 --> 01:34:35.356
ELLIOTT:
Blanc. coming with us?

2202
01:34:35.358 --> 01:34:37.625
BENOIT: I'll drive with Marta.

2203
01:34:37.627 --> 01:34:39.327
Let's go to the
police station.

2204
01:34:39.329 --> 01:34:42.731
I want a full rundown
on everything he said to you.

2205
01:34:42.733 --> 01:34:44.468
I'll catch you up
on where we're at.

2206
01:34:51.508 --> 01:34:54.277
<i>Strange case from the start.</i>

2207
01:34:55.445 --> 01:34:58.482
A case with a hole
in the middle.

2208
01:35:00.484 --> 01:35:01.685
A donut.

2209
01:35:02.719 --> 01:35:05.353
I'm just talking
through my process here.

2210
01:35:05.355 --> 01:35:07.689
let me know
if this is boring.

2211
01:35:07.691 --> 01:35:09.824
I feel the noose tightening.

2212
01:35:09.826 --> 01:35:12.429
The family is
truly desperate.

2213
01:35:12.963 --> 01:35:14.564
Desperate motives.

2214
01:35:15.432 --> 01:35:17.565
the mystery of who hired me.

2215
01:35:17.567 --> 01:35:19.369
the impossibility of the crime.

2216
01:35:20.437 --> 01:35:21.805
and yet...

2217
01:35:22.739 --> 01:35:24.639
A donut.

2218
01:35:24.641 --> 01:35:27.342
One central piece

2219
01:35:27.344 --> 01:35:30.445
and if it reveals itself.
the fog would lift.

2220
01:35:30.447 --> 01:35:34.649
the arc would resolve.
the Slinky become unkinked.

2221
01:35:34.651 --> 01:35:36.651
Do you mind
if I stop for a second?

2222
01:35:36.653 --> 01:35:38.120
I need to pick something up.

2223
01:35:38.122 --> 01:35:39.556
It'll be very quick.

2224
01:35:40.857 --> 01:35:42.025
Sure.

2225
01:35:55.639 --> 01:35:56.971
It'll be just a few minutes.

2226
01:35:56.973 --> 01:35:58.375
Watch the. uh.

2227
01:35:59.009 --> 01:36:00.010
door.

2228
01:36:03.513 --> 01:36:05.315
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

2229
01:36:22.566 --> 01:36:23.600
MARTA: Hello?

2230
01:36:24.401 --> 01:36:25.535
(WATER DRIPPING)

2231
01:36:47.457 --> 01:36:49.459
Listen. I don't know
what you want...

2232
01:36:52.028 --> 01:36:54.028
Whatever it is.
we can work it out.

2233
01:36:54.030 --> 01:36:56.764
But we have to figure it out
right here. right now.

2234
01:36:56.766 --> 01:36:58.635
And I'm leaving
with that report.

2235
01:37:03.074 --> 01:37:04.407
Hello?

2236
01:37:25.729 --> 01:37:26.963
(GASPS)

2237
01:37:29.599 --> 01:37:30.600
Fran?

2238
01:37:36.907 --> 01:37:38.039
(WHEEZING)

2239
01:37:38.041 --> 01:37:39.042
(GASPS)

2240
01:37:40.610 --> 01:37:43.044
No. no. no. no! Fran?

2241
01:37:43.046 --> 01:37:45.247
- (STIFLED GASPING)
- Oh. my God. Fran.

2242
01:37:45.249 --> 01:37:47.015
Can you hear me?

2243
01:37:47.017 --> 01:37:49.218
Fran. give me a sign
if you can hear me.

2244
01:37:49.220 --> 01:37:51.653
- You...
- Yes. it's me. It's Marta.

2245
01:37:51.655 --> 01:37:53.655
You called me here.
you sent me an email.

2246
01:37:53.657 --> 01:37:55.790
that's why I'm here.
Did you take something?

2247
01:37:55.792 --> 01:37:58.093
I'm gonna call an ambulance
now. you're gonna be okay.

2248
01:37:58.095 --> 01:37:59.261
You're gonna be fine. okay?

2249
01:37:59.263 --> 01:38:00.695
- Stay with me.
- Copy...

2250
01:38:00.697 --> 01:38:02.099
- What?
- Copy...

2251
01:38:03.200 --> 01:38:04.532
Stashed...

2252
01:38:04.534 --> 01:38:05.802
What? What are you saying?

2253
01:38:07.037 --> 01:38:09.238
You did this.

2254
01:38:09.240 --> 01:38:11.572
Won't get away with this.

2255
01:38:11.574 --> 01:38:12.742
Jesus. stop it!

2256
01:38:13.710 --> 01:38:15.645
(STIFLED GROANING)

2257
01:38:30.094 --> 01:38:31.993
(LINE RINGING)

2258
01:38:31.995 --> 01:38:33.195
(FRAN GASPS SOFTLY)

2259
01:38:33.197 --> 01:38:34.963
(GASPING STOPS)

2260
01:38:34.965 --> 01:38:36.967
DISPATCHER: <i>911.
what's your emergency?</i>

2261
01:38:38.202 --> 01:38:43.037
<i>♪ The thought of you
stays bright</i>

2262
01:38:43.039 --> 01:38:44.273
(SIREN WAILING)

2263
01:38:44.275 --> 01:38:49.180
<i>♪ Sometimes I stand
in the middle of the floor</i>

2264
01:38:50.814 --> 01:38:54.684
<i>♪ Not going left</i>

2265
01:38:55.885 --> 01:38:56.985
<i>♪ Not going...</i>

2266
01:38:56.987 --> 01:38:58.820
Oh. Lord.

2267
01:38:58.822 --> 01:39:00.322
(INDISTINCT ANNOUNCEMENT
OVER PA)

2268
01:39:00.324 --> 01:39:02.993
BENOIT: All right. my friend.
thank you for the update.

2269
01:39:04.095 --> 01:39:05.194
No need for that.

2270
01:39:05.196 --> 01:39:07.028
I'll bring her in
once we get word

2271
01:39:07.030 --> 01:39:08.763
that the housekeeper
is stable.

2272
01:39:08.765 --> 01:39:10.000
It's still
touch and go.

2273
01:39:10.667 --> 01:39:11.668
All right.

2274
01:39:13.070 --> 01:39:14.203
Listen. this is over.

2275
01:39:14.205 --> 01:39:15.839
People are getting hurt.

2276
01:39:18.641 --> 01:39:19.774
So I'm gonna
tell you the truth.

2277
01:39:19.776 --> 01:39:23.580
Young Ransom just told
Lieutenant Elliott everything.

2278
01:39:24.014 --> 01:39:24.879
Good.

2279
01:39:24.881 --> 01:39:27.149
Wait. I hope he
didn't cover for me.

2280
01:39:27.151 --> 01:39:28.816
Did he tell you
the real truth

2281
01:39:28.818 --> 01:39:30.852
- about me switching the...
- (SIGHS) Yeah.

2282
01:39:30.854 --> 01:39:32.221
- And the disguise bit?
- Yes.

2283
01:39:32.223 --> 01:39:33.855
And the whole blackmail and...

2284
01:39:33.857 --> 01:39:35.157
Mmm-hmm.

2285
01:39:35.159 --> 01:39:37.625
But why did Fran
take my morphine?

2286
01:39:37.627 --> 01:39:39.927
I mean. obviously she had
swiped the bag from the house.

2287
01:39:39.929 --> 01:39:41.963
but she didn't seem like
a user to me.

2288
01:39:41.965 --> 01:39:44.266
unless that's why she needed
the blackmail money.

2289
01:39:44.268 --> 01:39:46.201
I don't know.
it doesn't matter anyway.

2290
01:39:46.203 --> 01:39:48.103
I have to tell the
Thrombeys myself.

2291
01:39:48.105 --> 01:39:49.171
I feel like I owe that to them.

2292
01:39:49.173 --> 01:39:50.905
I don't think
that's a good idea.

2293
01:39:50.907 --> 01:39:53.009
No. I have to do it.
I need to do it.

2294
01:39:54.978 --> 01:39:56.378
I gave the doctors
my number.

2295
01:39:56.380 --> 01:39:58.180
so they'll call if anything
changes with Fran.

2296
01:39:58.182 --> 01:39:59.148
All right.

2297
01:39:59.150 --> 01:40:01.083
I'll round up the Thrombeys
at the house.

2298
01:40:01.085 --> 01:40:03.185
along with a police escort.

2299
01:40:03.187 --> 01:40:05.387
For the arrest after.

2300
01:40:05.389 --> 01:40:07.924
You can tell me your whole
story on the drive over.

2301
01:40:09.160 --> 01:40:11.095
I don't want
any more surprises.

2302
01:40:26.910 --> 01:40:28.410
MARTA: Fran said
it was stashed.

2303
01:40:28.412 --> 01:40:29.879
the copy. and then she said.

2304
01:40:31.047 --> 01:40:33.282
"You did this.
You won't get away with it."

2305
01:40:33.284 --> 01:40:35.985
and I called the ambulance.

2306
01:40:36.753 --> 01:40:37.854
That's it.

2307
01:40:39.056 --> 01:40:40.057
All right.

2308
01:40:42.226 --> 01:40:44.661
- You ready?
- (SIGHS SOFTLY)

2309
01:40:49.300 --> 01:40:50.698
RICHARD: Oh!

2310
01:40:50.700 --> 01:40:52.134
Okay.

2311
01:40:52.136 --> 01:40:54.169
Well. has she
come to her senses?

2312
01:40:54.171 --> 01:40:55.803
Well. she's standing
right there. Richard.

2313
01:40:55.805 --> 01:40:56.871
she can speak for herself.

2314
01:40:56.873 --> 01:40:57.939
Is the rest
of the family here?

2315
01:40:57.941 --> 01:40:59.006
WALT: In the living room.

2316
01:40:59.008 --> 01:41:00.041
I think that it
would be better

2317
01:41:00.043 --> 01:41:02.346
if we were to gather again
and get this over with.

2318
01:41:08.017 --> 01:41:09.386
- Hey.
- Hey.

2319
01:41:11.788 --> 01:41:13.754
I'm so sorry I told
them about your mom.

2320
01:41:13.756 --> 01:41:16.191
Meg. it's okay.

2321
01:41:16.193 --> 01:41:17.825
I'm sorry. No...
I was scared. I just...

2322
01:41:17.827 --> 01:41:18.926
I didn't wanna tell them.

2323
01:41:18.928 --> 01:41:19.996
I get it.

2324
01:41:20.431 --> 01:41:21.664
Trust me.

2325
01:41:22.433 --> 01:41:24.701
I understand.
It's all right.

2326
01:41:25.269 --> 01:41:26.803
(SNIFFLES) I'm sorry.

2327
01:41:28.405 --> 01:41:30.004
(SIGHS. CHUCKLES)

2328
01:41:30.006 --> 01:41:32.840
God. I am so raiding
Fran's stash after this.

2329
01:41:32.842 --> 01:41:35.977
BENOIT: I still think
this is a bad idea.

2330
01:41:35.979 --> 01:41:38.115
but the family is assembled.

2331
01:41:41.385 --> 01:41:43.254
I know where
the tox report is.

2332
01:41:50.927 --> 01:41:52.662
She basically told me
where it was.

2333
01:41:55.099 --> 01:41:57.000
Anyways. this will
tie everything up.

2334
01:41:59.236 --> 01:42:00.870
And I just
handed it to you.

2335
01:42:02.339 --> 01:42:04.874
God. you're not much
of a detective. are you?

2336
01:42:05.376 --> 01:42:07.043
Well. to be fair.

2337
01:42:08.912 --> 01:42:11.248
you make
a pretty lousy murderer.

2338
01:42:13.250 --> 01:42:15.018
Perhaps we
deserve each other.

2339
01:42:27.198 --> 01:42:28.898
You've always
been good to me.

2340
01:42:30.867 --> 01:42:33.034
And what I'm about to say
isn't gonna be easy

2341
01:42:33.036 --> 01:42:35.103
and you're gonna
be upset.

2342
01:42:35.105 --> 01:42:37.239
But I thought after
what you've gone through

2343
01:42:37.241 --> 01:42:38.309
the last few days.

2344
01:42:39.476 --> 01:42:42.009
that you deserved
to hear it from me.

2345
01:42:42.011 --> 01:42:43.147
Hmm.

2346
01:42:44.981 --> 01:42:46.250
- I...
- Excuse me!

2347
01:42:50.554 --> 01:42:53.821
You have not been good to her.

2348
01:42:53.823 --> 01:42:55.990
You have all
treated her like shit.

2349
01:42:55.992 --> 01:42:58.427
to steal back a fortune
that you lost.

2350
01:42:58.429 --> 01:43:00.162
and she deserves.

2351
01:43:00.164 --> 01:43:03.165
You're a pack of vultures
at the feast!

2352
01:43:03.167 --> 01:43:05.133
Knives out. beaks bloody!

2353
01:43:05.135 --> 01:43:07.102
Well... (INHALES SHARPLY)

2354
01:43:07.104 --> 01:43:10.472
You're not getting bailed
out. not this time.

2355
01:43:10.474 --> 01:43:13.375
Ms. Cabrera has
decided. definitively.

2356
01:43:13.377 --> 01:43:15.277
not to renounce
the inheritance.

2357
01:43:15.279 --> 01:43:17.112
- What?
- What?

2358
01:43:17.114 --> 01:43:20.115
Furthermore. it will be
my professional recommendation

2359
01:43:20.117 --> 01:43:22.551
to the local authorities
that the manner of death

2360
01:43:22.553 --> 01:43:26.555
in the case of Harlan Thrombey
is ruled as suicide!

2361
01:43:26.557 --> 01:43:28.223
- And the case is closed.
- Blanc?

2362
01:43:28.225 --> 01:43:29.291
What?

2363
01:43:29.293 --> 01:43:31.093
Thank you all for coming.
Goodbye.

2364
01:43:31.095 --> 01:43:32.496
What's going on?
Just tell me...

2365
01:43:34.465 --> 01:43:37.132
That's certainly not
what I was expecting.

2366
01:43:37.134 --> 01:43:38.367
- DONNA: No.
- (DOG GROWLS)

2367
01:43:38.369 --> 01:43:39.334
RICHARD:
Is anybody else confused?

2368
01:43:39.336 --> 01:43:41.804
WALT: Not what I was expecting
to hear at all.

2369
01:43:42.273 --> 01:43:44.339
(CHUCKLES)

2370
01:43:44.341 --> 01:43:45.940
Are you gonna tell me
what the hell is going on?

2371
01:43:45.942 --> 01:43:47.175
Yes. Yes.

2372
01:43:47.177 --> 01:43:49.043
I just wanna come clean. okay?

2373
01:43:49.045 --> 01:43:50.345
- It's over.
- Almost.

2374
01:43:50.347 --> 01:43:51.846
Blanc. what are we doing?

2375
01:43:51.848 --> 01:43:54.216
- What's going on?
- I'm sorry. Officer Wagner.

2376
01:43:54.218 --> 01:43:55.950
Keep the family
out of this room.

2377
01:43:55.952 --> 01:43:57.352
and get 'em out of
the house if you can.

2378
01:43:57.354 --> 01:43:59.488
But stand by
with your additional officer.

2379
01:43:59.490 --> 01:44:00.522
Get the family out?

2380
01:44:00.524 --> 01:44:02.457
Yes. but not all of them.
Would you... (WHISPERS)

2381
01:44:02.459 --> 01:44:03.558
Thank you.

2382
01:44:03.560 --> 01:44:04.493
- ELLIOTT: Blanc...
- WAGNER: Yes. sir.

2383
01:44:04.495 --> 01:44:06.361
Come on. come on.
what's all this drama?

2384
01:44:06.363 --> 01:44:08.196
- Indulge me.
- MARTA: Blanc.

2385
01:44:08.198 --> 01:44:10.065
I told Ransom. Ransom told you.

2386
01:44:10.067 --> 01:44:11.600
and I'm telling you now.

2387
01:44:11.602 --> 01:44:14.569
it is an immovable fact
that I killed Harlan.

2388
01:44:14.571 --> 01:44:17.239
Yes. you did. yes. he did.
yes. you are.

2389
01:44:17.241 --> 01:44:20.442
But... But. I spoke in the car
about the hole

2390
01:44:20.444 --> 01:44:22.577
at the center of this donut.

2391
01:44:22.579 --> 01:44:25.314
And what you and Harlan did
that fateful night

2392
01:44:25.316 --> 01:44:28.517
seems at first glance
to fill that hole perfectly.

2393
01:44:28.519 --> 01:44:31.919
A donut hole in a donut's hole.

2394
01:44:31.921 --> 01:44:34.523
But we must
look a little closer.

2395
01:44:34.525 --> 01:44:37.559
And when we do.
we see the donut hole

2396
01:44:37.561 --> 01:44:39.960
has a hole in its center.

2397
01:44:39.962 --> 01:44:42.130
It is not a donut hole.

2398
01:44:42.132 --> 01:44:45.100
but a smaller donut
with its own hole

2399
01:44:45.102 --> 01:44:48.070
and our donut
is not whole at all!

2400
01:44:48.072 --> 01:44:50.238
Blanc. look. I understand that
this is amusing for you...

2401
01:44:50.240 --> 01:44:52.443
Why was I hired?

2402
01:44:53.243 --> 01:44:54.975
Why would someone hire me?

2403
01:44:54.977 --> 01:44:56.378
ELLIOTT: Someone fishing
for a crime

2404
01:44:56.380 --> 01:44:57.679
to reverse the will. Blanc.
Come on.

2405
01:44:57.681 --> 01:45:00.182
But I was hired before
the sealed will was read.

2406
01:45:00.184 --> 01:45:01.483
So. yes.

2407
01:45:01.485 --> 01:45:04.619
the person must have known
the contents of the will.

2408
01:45:04.621 --> 01:45:05.721
But one step further.

2409
01:45:05.723 --> 01:45:09.124
that same person must have
known a crime was committed.

2410
01:45:09.126 --> 01:45:11.059
and further...

2411
01:45:11.061 --> 01:45:16.098
If the intent was to reverse
Marta's inheritance.

2412
01:45:16.100 --> 01:45:19.167
they must have known
that Marta was responsible.

2413
01:45:19.169 --> 01:45:21.536
An intriguing combination
of factors.

2414
01:45:21.538 --> 01:45:23.338
Someone who knew
what Marta did

2415
01:45:23.340 --> 01:45:25.005
wanted to expose it

2416
01:45:25.007 --> 01:45:27.041
but could not reveal
how they knew.

2417
01:45:27.043 --> 01:45:28.410
Fran!

2418
01:45:28.412 --> 01:45:31.246
She was blackmailing me.
She knew what I did.

2419
01:45:31.248 --> 01:45:32.581
Yeah. but Fran wanted money.

2420
01:45:32.583 --> 01:45:35.050
ergo she did not want
the crime exposed.

2421
01:45:35.052 --> 01:45:36.585
What if someone
in the family had observed

2422
01:45:36.587 --> 01:45:37.686
Marta doing
something suspicious?

2423
01:45:37.688 --> 01:45:41.091
But they would have had
no reason not to speak up.

2424
01:45:41.658 --> 01:45:42.724
(SIGHS)

2425
01:45:42.726 --> 01:45:46.728
The answer
is not so simple.

2426
01:45:46.730 --> 01:45:51.299
Now with the entire solution
in my field of view.

2427
01:45:51.301 --> 01:45:54.338
the arc of this case
is a tragedy of errors.

2428
01:45:56.407 --> 01:45:59.143
(SIGHS) Marta it will not
be easy for you to hear.

2429
01:45:59.676 --> 01:46:02.310
But there is at least

2430
01:46:02.312 --> 01:46:05.347
one truly guilty party
behind it all.

2431
01:46:05.349 --> 01:46:08.517
guilty in the true sense
of acting with malice

2432
01:46:08.519 --> 01:46:12.189
and committing a heinous crime
with selfish intent.

2433
01:46:15.024 --> 01:46:16.258
Trooper Wagner.

2434
01:46:16.260 --> 01:46:17.694
Trooper Wagner?

2435
01:46:19.028 --> 01:46:20.029
No.

2436
01:46:22.199 --> 01:46:24.399
Marta. I'm so sorry.
I told them everything.

2437
01:46:24.401 --> 01:46:26.067
I figured it was up.
I'm sorry.

2438
01:46:26.069 --> 01:46:28.437
Hey. It's all right. Ransom.
I'm glad you did.

2439
01:46:28.439 --> 01:46:31.038
Not exactly
everything though.

2440
01:46:31.040 --> 01:46:33.341
MARTA: Is this about
what Greatnana told you?

2441
01:46:33.343 --> 01:46:36.311
She saw me that night.
She mistook me for Ransom.

2442
01:46:36.313 --> 01:46:37.379
We'll get to that.

2443
01:46:37.381 --> 01:46:39.414
In the meanwhile.

2444
01:46:39.416 --> 01:46:42.217
Mr. Hugh Ransom Drysdale.

2445
01:46:42.219 --> 01:46:46.022
you might tell us all
why you hired me.

2446
01:46:49.326 --> 01:46:51.393
Why I hired you?

2447
01:46:51.395 --> 01:46:53.595
You're right.
let's back it up...

2448
01:46:53.597 --> 01:46:55.230
To the night of the party.

2449
01:46:55.232 --> 01:46:57.699
<i>Your argument with Harlan.</i>

2450
01:46:57.701 --> 01:46:59.301
What were the overheard words

2451
01:46:59.303 --> 01:47:02.404
by the Nazi child
masturbating in the bathroom?

2452
01:47:02.406 --> 01:47:06.074
<i>"My will." and
"I'm warning you."</i>

2453
01:47:06.076 --> 01:47:08.510
You and Harlan
were drama mamas.

2454
01:47:08.512 --> 01:47:11.546
you shared a love of twisting
the knife into one another.

2455
01:47:11.548 --> 01:47:13.148
You see. I don't believe

2456
01:47:13.150 --> 01:47:14.649
he would have
slipped it in halfway.

2457
01:47:14.651 --> 01:47:15.652
no. no. no.

2458
01:47:16.487 --> 01:47:18.286
I submit

2459
01:47:18.288 --> 01:47:20.789
Harlan told you everything.

2460
01:47:20.791 --> 01:47:22.257
You can't be serious!

2461
01:47:22.259 --> 01:47:25.660
Not a red dime
or word of my work

2462
01:47:25.662 --> 01:47:28.198
to a single one of them.
you included.

2463
01:47:28.532 --> 01:47:30.065
Marta.

2464
01:47:30.067 --> 01:47:31.466
remind me what Ransom said

2465
01:47:31.468 --> 01:47:34.603
his conversation
with Harlan ended with?

2466
01:47:34.605 --> 01:47:37.205
Harlan told him that
I could beat him at Go.

2467
01:47:37.207 --> 01:47:39.107
BENOIT: And I asked myself.

2468
01:47:39.109 --> 01:47:40.275
"Marta?

2469
01:47:40.277 --> 01:47:42.310
"Why would the topic of the will

2470
01:47:42.312 --> 01:47:44.715
"have steered around
to Marta?"

2471
01:47:45.849 --> 01:47:49.251
There is one
obvious explanation...

2472
01:47:49.253 --> 01:47:50.285
You can't be that crazy.

2473
01:47:50.287 --> 01:47:52.287
You're not just gonna
throw away your fortune.

2474
01:47:52.289 --> 01:47:54.322
No. I'm giving it to Marta.

2475
01:47:54.324 --> 01:47:55.624
All of it.

